  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While replenishing his wolf groups through treasure yellow heaven, Fang Yuan has Little Hu Immortal inquire about a turtleback myriad wolf king on offer. The Gu Immortal who put that listing up called himself South Sea Turtle Immortal and asked for ten thousand stalks of blowpipe grass.",
      "chapters": [
