      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has no blowpipe grass in season, so Little Hu Immortal asks whether immortal essence stones are acceptable. The seller answers that twenty thousand turtleback wolves can be sold for two immortal essence stones. After haggling, Fang Yuan pays one immortal essence stone and buys thirty thousand turtleback wolves and one turtleback myriad wolf king from South Sea Turtle Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
